file-named errors. Phase 4 needs the public service request/decision vocabulary aligned with the internal v0.11 policy model.\u0026#xA;\u0026#xA;SCOPE\u0026#xA;In scope: service.go RouteRequest, RouteDecision, RoutePowerPolicy policy field names; service_routing.go request translation; routing_errors.go public policy error types; service routing tests.\u0026#xA;Out of scope: removing ModelRef fields, session-log model-ref projection, CLI route-status flags, provider/model billing metadata.\u0026#xA;\u0026#xA;IMPLEMENTATION NOTES\u0026#xA;Rename RouteRequest.Profile to Policy and add AllowLocal/Require fields if they are not already present. Rename RouteDecision.RequestedProfile to RequestedPolicy. Rename RoutePowerPolicy.Profile to PolicyName. Replace ErrProfilePinConflict/ErrNoProfileCandidate/ErrUnknownProfile with ErrPolicyRequirementUnsatisfied, ErrUnknownPolicy, and ErrUnsatisfiablePin shapes mirroring internal routing errors. Translate req.Policy=\u0026#34;air-gapped\u0026#34; into routing require=[\u0026#34;no_remote\u0026#34;].\n    \u003c/description\u003e\n    \u003cacceptance\u003e\n1. `go test . -run TestServiceTranslatesPolicyAirGappedToRequireNoRemote -count=1` passes.\u0026#xA;2. `go test . -run TestErrPolicyRequirementUnsatisfiedShape -count=1` passes.\u0026#xA;3. `grep -rn \u0026#34;RequestedProfile\\|RoutePowerPolicy.*Profile\\|ErrProfilePinConflict\\|ErrNoProfileCandidate\\|ErrUnknownProfile\u0026#34; service.go service_*.go routing_errors.go --include=\u0026#34;*.go\u0026#34;` returns zero matches in production files.\u0026#xA;4. `go test ./... -count=1` passes.\n    \u003c/acceptance\u003e\n    \u003cnotes\u003e\nImplemented in f0a6fe7e. Verification: go test . -run \u0026#39;TestServiceTranslatesPolicyAirGappedToRequireNoRemote|TestErrPolicyRequirementUnsatisfiedShape\u0026#39; -count=1; structural grep for old public profile errors/fields in service production files returned no matches; go test ./... -count=1; lefthook run pre-commit --all-files.\u0026#xA;\u0026#xA;Review 2026-05-12: ADR-009 hard-cut/no-alias intent is violated; service still accepts legacy aliases such as standard, local/offline, fast/code-fast/code-smart/code-economy. Remove compatibility maps and add rejection tests.\n    \u003c/notes\u003e\n    \u003clabels\u003earea:service, area:routing, kind:rename, phase:4, breaking, spec-id:ADR-009\u003c/labels\u003e\n    \u003cmetadata parent=\"fizeau-c6c8bc9e\" spec-id=\"ADR-009\" base-rev=\"be029b72a7b6fbbf5fa02bb52dbfaf1e9515b13d\" bundle=\".ddx/executions/20260512T150441-9fe5cf1c\"/\u003e\n  \u003c/bead\u003e\n  \u003cgoverning\u003e\n    \u003cref id=\"ADR-009\" path=\"docs/helix/02-design/adr/ADR-009-routing-surface-redesign.md\"\u003eADR-009: Routing Surface Redesign\u003c/ref\u003e\n  \u003c/governing\u003e\n\u003c/execute-bead\u003e\n","metadata":{"DDX_MODE":"bead_execution","attempt_id":"20260512T150441-9fe5cf1c","base_rev":"be029b72a7b6fbbf5fa02bb52dbfaf1e9515b13d","bead_id":"fizeau-22a93208","bundle_path":".ddx/executions/20260512T150441-9fe5cf1c","correlation_id":"fizeau-22a93208:20260512T150441-9fe5cf1c","prompt_file":".ddx/executions/20260512T150441-9fe5cf1c/prompt.md","prompt_sha":"f810b5458be0818070e2fc70a89f648171bbd7b852783ce5c9e782a06a89c9e0","role":"implementer","session_id":"eb-05d77cd4","worker_id":""}}}
